as confirmed when we tested its csiD knockout strain (\u0394csiD) by LC-MS of small-molecule extracts: with carbon starvation and entry into the stationary phase, the intracellular concentration of GA accumulated to much higher levels in the \u0394csiD strain than compared to the wildtype (Fig.\u00a02d). While it is commonly encoded in Enterobacteriaceae, CsiD is found also in genomes of many other proteobacteria and bacilli (Supplementary Figure\u00a04).","representation":"primary_jats","section_id":"Sec3","source_ref":"source_20b1857107fd20e31182f2db"},"subject":"CsiD","uncertainty":{"count":null,"kind":"unspecified","magnitude":7.0,"sampling_basis":"unspecified"},"unit":"uM","value":100.0,"version":"a105_jats_quantity_v1"},"interpretation_limits":["subject_token_presence_is_not_experimental_attribution","reported_specific_activity_does_not_establish_product_identity","reported_spread_with_unspecified_meaning_is_not_SEM_or_SD","apparent_km_is_not_affinity_or_an_activity_rate"],"scope":"reported_source_quantity","source_conditions":null},"version":"literature_source_quantity_record_v2"}